CLAUDE.local.md

# Local agent harness — machine-local, not committed. `.claude/skills/` and
# `.agents/skills/` are where `scripts/link-skills.sh` and each agent host
# install skills for *this* checkout; the repo publishes its own via skills.sh,
# so a committed copy here would be a second, silently-stale source of truth.
# The rest is per-host config that has not earned a place in the repo yet.
#
# Merely leaving these untracked is not enough: `forkcheck` counts any
# undeclared path as drift and `test_forkcheck.sh` asserts a clean tree, so an
# unignored copy fails both on every machine that has one. To commit any of
# them, drop its line and add an Additions row to `.fork/divergence.md` in the
# same change — that is the file `forkcheck` reads to decide a path is ours.
.claude/
.agents/skills/
.codex/
prompts/
.DS_Store